Divide the square into $16$ smaller squares as shown. The shaded square is formed from $4$ half-squares, so its area is $2.$ The ratio $2$ to $16$ is $\boxed{\frac{1}{8}}.$

Note: There are several other ways to divide the region to show this. [asy]
